      "text": "02",
      "boundary": "body"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "sourceIndex": 14,
      "text": "家婆说“省着点花",
      "boundary": "body"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "sourceIndex": 15,
      "text": "别买那些没用的东西”",
      "boundary": "body"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "sourceIndex": 16,
      "text": "我不争不辩",
      "boundary": "body"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "sourceIndex": 17,
      "text": "转头买的快递都寄到公司",
      "boundary": "body"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "sourceIndex": 18,
      "text": "拆了塞包里带回家",
      "boundary": "body"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "sourceIndex": 19,
      "text": "她问“新买的？”",
      "boundary": "body"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "sourceIndex": 20,
      "text": "我说“同事不要的”",
      "boundary": "body"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "sourceIndex": 21,
      "text": "她说“这同事不错”",
      "boundary": "body"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "sourceIndex": 22,
